<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<div>
  Starts an AutoForge task from Jenkins Pipeline, reports progress every 30 seconds, and waits for its terminal lifecycle.
  Required parameters: <code>baseUrl</code>, <code>apiKey</code>, and <code>suiteId</code>.
  Optional parameter: <code>timeoutSeconds</code> (zero uses the server recommendation).
</div>
